.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.OTOLARYNGOLOGY2012-107383.004"/></fig><fig id="fig5" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p>CD34 reactivity. </p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.OTOLARYNGOLOGY2012-107383.005"/></fig></floats-group></article>